                        M = 5 * 11 * 17 = 935<br>
                        M1 = 11 * 17 = 187<br>
                        M2 = 5 * 17 = 85<br>
                        M3 = 5 * 11<br>
                        <br>
                        y1 = 187<sup>-1</sup> mod5 = 3 <br>
                        y2 = 85<sup>-1</sup> mod11 = 7 <br>
                        y3 = 55<sup>-1</sup> mod17 = 13 <br>
                        <br>
                        x=2*187*3 + 3*85*7 + 5*55*13 = 1122 + 1785 + 3575 = 6482<br>
                        6482 mod935 = 872<br>
                        <br>
                        In SageMath:
                    </p>
